cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "RECIPE: Re-mixing Embeddings via Clustering for Patient augmEntation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of RECIPE, a statistically grounded patient-level
  augmentation method for multiple instance learning that generates artificial
  patients by re-mixing instance embeddings according to class-specific
  cluster-composition recipes.
